{{!-- "You're already a member" surface — shown to paid, comped, or
     staff-preview-email visitors on the /membership/ page in place
     of the pricing cards. Extracted so the partials/membership-body
     gate can reference it from one branch without duplicating the
     markup three times (paid / comped / preview). --}}
<section class="pricing">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="already-member">You're already a member. <a href="/manage">Manage your membership &rarr;</a></p>
    {{!-- The one thing a current member can still buy for themselves.
         Without it this whole surface is a dead end, and the only way
         to go Lifetime was to cancel first and then buy. Hides itself
         for members who already hold Lifetime. --}}
    {{> "lifetime-upgrade"}}
    {{!-- Members still see the other ways to share / join (gift, group,
         institutions, student). --}}
    {{> "other-memberships"}}
  </div>
</section>
